id: tame
name: Tame
prerequisite: 2+ Skill Ranks in Animal Handling
# "Animal Handling" is the Creature Handling Skill (the user's ruling).
requiresSkill: creatureHandling
requiresRanks: 2
sessionLimit: 1
timeCost: 1 Day
# The Minion Creation Rules are not in this system: what it does is said on the card.
effectNote: creates a Minion of the Animal Minion Race
source: Core Rule
description: >
  A day with a wild animal: a Minion of the Animal Minion Race, following your lead.
text: >
  Tame: You subdue a wild animal, teaching it to follow your lead.
  –Prerequisite: 2+ Skill Ranks in Animal Handling
  –Session Limit: 1
  –Time Cost: 1 Day
  –Effect: Create a Minion. This Minion must be of the Animal Minion Race.

---

# Offered on the Adventure tab to whoever has 2+ Ranks in Creature Handling - the entry's "Animal
# Handling" (the user's ruling). Once the day is spent, the card says a Minion of the Animal Minion
# Race is made: the Minion Creation Rules are not built, so making it is the table's.
